     <actual value="80">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased vocational skills: Achieved through tailored training sessions in tailoring, garment
cutting, and soap-making, led by experienced instructors and facilitated by the project team. The anticipated number of rightsholders was 50, but the actual count exceeded expectations, reaching 80. This positive variance can be attributed to the
proactive nature of trained rightsholders who willingly shared their skills with others. Furthermore, an additional thirty individuals are currently undergoing training at VOHARO&#x2019;s center, thanks to the efforts of the
trained rightsholders. They are not only using
the workshop for their own businesses but are also providing complimentary training
to others, thereby amplifying the project&amp;impact.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
